{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32638","headline":"题桃源处士山居留寄 · 刘沧","name":"题桃源处士山居留寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云深处葺茅庐，退隐衡门与俗疎。\n一洞晓烟留水上，满庭春露落花初。\n闲看竹屿吟新月，特酌山醪读古书。\n穷达尽爲身外事，浩然元气乐樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}